
### 1. Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### 2. Registreren
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "amber",
  "password": "FlowlyTest123!"
}

### 3. Inloggen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "amber",
  "password": "FlowlyTest123!"
}

### 4. Projectboards ophalen
GET http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards

### 5. Projectboard aanmaken
POST http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mijn eerste projectboard"
}

### 6. Test: projectboard aanmaken zonder naam
POST http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### 7. Projectboard aanpassen
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Flowly - Mijn project"
}

### 8. Test: projectboard aanpassen met lege naam
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   "
}

### 9. Test: niet-bestaand projectboard aanpassen
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bestaat niet"
}

### 10. Projectboard verwijderen
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards/1

### 11. Projectboard aanmaken voor FR-03
POST http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Testboard voor taken"
}

### 12. Eerste taak aanmaken
POST http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards/2/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Eerste testtaak",
  "description": "Controleren of taken aangemaakt kunnen worden."
}

### 13. Taken van projectboard ophalen
GET http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards/2/tasks

### 14. Taak aanpassen
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards/2/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Flowly backend afronden",
  "description": "De CRUD-functionaliteit voor taken testen en afronden."
}

### 15. Test: taak aanpassen met lege titel
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards/2/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Deze wijziging mag niet worden opgeslagen."
}

### 16. Controleren of taakgegevens behouden zijn
GET http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards/2/tasks

### 17. Test: niet-bestaande taak aanpassen
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards/2/tasks/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bestaat niet",
  "description": "Deze taak bestaat niet."
}

### 18. Taak verwijderen
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards/2/tasks/1

### 19. Controleren of taak verwijderd is
GET http://localhost:8080/api/project-boards/2/tasks